lets (optionally under `##` sections) that always hangs under an[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]area, project, or notebook. Capture writes notes into notebooks [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]through the existing `@nb` forms, creates notebooks with [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`@parent^id@ %n <summary>`, and every area or project shows a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]beautiful generated `## Notebooks` catalog. 26 existing notes, 11 [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]of them rescued from the zorg dead end, become the first notebooks.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]10[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob_notebooks.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/bob_notebooks.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-j8[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-j8/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Notebook recognition, bob notebooks list and check, and the [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]contract doc[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]notebook-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]notebook-core: recognize `type: \"[\\[notebook]]\"`, add the notebooks [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]module (one vault scan, path-aware parents, owner and root through the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]existing Root Parent walk, title, summary, sections, counts), the `bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notebooks list` and `check` commands with beautiful human output and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON, teaching refusals wherever a notebook is offered as a task or [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference home, and `docs/notebooks.md`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold 